WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:04.298
In one cancer context a signalling pathway can favour

00:00:04.298 --> 00:00:07.834
tumour growth. In another it may help restrain it.

00:00:13.425 --> 00:00:17.172
SLIT2 binds ROBO receptors through a broad protein

00:00:17.172 --> 00:00:21.144
interface, shaped by cellular location and associated

00:00:21.144 --> 00:00:21.818
partners.

00:00:28.092 --> 00:00:31.677
We surveyed patent families from twenty twenty through

00:00:31.677 --> 00:00:35.263
twenty twenty-six, examining the proposed intervention

00:00:35.263 --> 00:00:36.923
and experimental support.

00:00:43.425 --> 00:00:46.967
Antibodies, ligand traps and other strategies promise

00:00:46.967 --> 00:00:50.508
different forms of pathway disruption. Not all claims

00:00:50.508 --> 00:00:53.248
demonstrate the same level of enablement.

00:01:00.383 --> 00:01:03.587
A useful inhibitor must be matched to the tumour

00:01:03.587 --> 00:01:04.054
biology

00:01:04.054 --> 00:01:07.070
where the pathway is actually driving disease.

00:01:12.258 --> 00:01:15.508
The question is not simply whether the axis can be

00:01:15.508 --> 00:01:18.815
blocked, but when blocking it will make biological

00:01:18.815 --> 00:01:19.212
sense.
